{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/in-mbl-royal","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"hits":[{"rank":null,"slug":"mbl-royal-mag-jlt-jumeirah-lake-towers","about":"MBL Royal is a luxury 42-storey residential complex by MAG PD offering 1-3 bedroom apartments located in Jumeirah Lakes Towers (JLT) in Dubai. The Royal class apartments are presented by the best architects and interior designers. All residences have balconies from which residents can enjoy views of Jumeirah Island and lake views. There are fully equipped kitchens, walk-in closets, separate cooling controls for each room, and fully equipped bathrooms.Premium amenities include an adult landscape pool, children's pool, outdoor Jacuzzi and spa, children's playground, large gym, BBQ areas and massage room.With its strategic location in Cluster K at JLT, residents live surrounded by lakes and green spaces. The project offers easy navigation due to the proximity of major road networks including Sheikh Zayed Road.The JLT area has a well-developed infrastructure with 5 hotels, 3 universities, supermarkets, medical centers, shopping outlets and restaurants as well as parks and jogging paths. Just a 10-minute walk from the MBL Royal Hotel are Vanila Wedding Boutique, Tempo Dance Center, Al Maya-JLT N Supermarket, In N Out Supermarket, Align Pilates DMCC Wellness Center and several restaurants. The large Almas Tower business center is less than a 15-minute walk from MBL Royal.","price":1950000,"title":"MBL Royal","bitrix":{"id":512,"pf_id":"are.2.11859","source":null,"project_id":"MBL Royal","tower_name":null,"campaign_name":"MBL Royal","property_type":"Apartment","developer_name":"MAG Group","project_location":"Jumeirah Lake Towers"},"images":[{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/off-plan/1086/images/2024/02/22/340x252/fJ4GGXJ2NGGSVS57BFa1yyHxV2Xr2TI9amyjbBxM.webp","464x312":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/off-plan/1086/images/2024/02/